1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:04,930
Dukaan Mumbai mein hai… par customer poore India mein chahiye?

2
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:10,427
To miliye Bombay Marketing se — Andheri West ki ecommerce growth agency.

3
00:00:10,777 --> 00:00:19,050
Pehla kaam — BUILD. Shopify ya WooCommerce store… payments, shipping, WhatsApp, tracking, sab set.

4
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:27,652
Doosra — LAUNCH. Amazon, Flipkart, Myntra, Blinkit, Zepto aur Instamart pe seller onboarding.

5
00:00:28,002 --> 00:00:36,345
Teesra — GROW. SEO, social media, Meta aur Google ads… aur naap sirf ek — sales.

6
00:00:36,695 --> 00:00:42,088
Upar se packaging design aur branding bhi… taaki product shelf pe chamke.

7
00:00:43,488 --> 00:00:49,378
Free audit book kijiye — bombaymarketing.in. Build, Launch, Grow!
